        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gas motor Mini CHP plant
Inventory based on information from manufacturer (Ecopower 1997;
UUID: 3a7b3e10-935c-3660-bc13-7b33f0aa62c4
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Specific manufacturer (Ecopower in Switzerland)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a7b3e10-935c-3660-bc13-7b33f0aa62c4.xml</text>
